    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70380" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεοσσ-ίον</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεοττ-</span></b>  (later <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοσσίον</span></b>  Lyr.in <i><span class="en">
			<u>Philol.</u>
			80.336
		</span></i>), τό, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεοσσός,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>nestling, chick,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				536a30
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ πατρὸς ν.</span>
			'chip of the old block', <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				767
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				2.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>yolk</i> of an egg, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				42
			</span></i> (prob.), <i><span class="en">
				Diph.
				121
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
